WEBVTT

00:04:29.636 --> 00:04:31.105
You talk about what you like.

00:04:31.129 --> 00:04:32.661
You may even negotiate it.

00:04:32.685 --> 00:04:35.430
"How do you feel
about pepperoni?" (Laughter)

00:04:35.454 --> 00:04:38.057
"Not so much, I'm kind
of a mushroom guy myself."

00:04:38.081 --> 00:04:40.123
"Well, maybe we can go half and half."

00:04:40.147 --> 00:04:42.147
And even if you've had pizza with somebody

00:04:42.171 --> 00:04:45.182
for a very long time,

00:04:45.206 --> 00:04:47.244
don't you still say things like,

00:04:47.268 --> 00:04:49.237
"Should we get the usual?"

00:04:49.261 --> 00:04:50.400
(Laughter)

00:04:50.424 --> 00:04:54.157
"Or maybe something
a little more adventurous?"

00:04:54.181 --> 00:04:55.991
Okay, so when you're playing baseball,

00:04:56.015 --> 00:04:58.109
so if we talk
about during sexual activity,

00:04:58.133 --> 00:04:59.514
when you're playing baseball,

00:04:59.538 --> 00:05:02.042
you're just supposed to round the bases